BT /F2 13 Tf 42.00 742.00 Td (Step-by-Step Process) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F2 11 Tf 42.00 722.00 Td (1. Dataset Upload and Loading) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 707.00 Td (The user uploads a dataset through the dashboard. The FastAPI backend saves the file and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 694.00 Td (loads it using the correct reader for CSV, Excel, JSON, or Parquet.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 42.00 669.00 Td (2. Automated Data Profiling) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 654.00 Td (The DataProfiler studies the dataset with pandas and numpy. It extracts row count,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 641.00 Td (column count, data types, missing values, duplicates, suggested target, class count,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 628.00 Td (imbalance ratio, and time-series indicators.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 42.00 603.00 Td (3. Data Quality Analysis) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 588.00 Td (The DataAgent reviews metadata and identifies practical concerns such as missing values,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 575.00 Td (duplicate records, class imbalance, unsuitable feature types, or weak target selection.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 42.00 550.00 Td (4. Task Detection) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 535.00 Td (The TaskAgent determines whether the problem is classification, regression, clustering,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 522.00 Td (or forecasting. This decision guides model selection, preprocessing, metrics, and final) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 509.00 Td (reporting.) Tj ET
0.82 0.09 0.10 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 42.00 484.00 Td (Why This Process Is Useful) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F2 9 Tf 42.00 464.00 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 464.00 Td (It reduces manual effort for users who may not know every ML step.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 42.00 451.00 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 451.00 Td (It keeps the workflow consistent across different datasets.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 42.00 438.00 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 438.00 Td (It allows AI agents to guide decisions while proven ML libraries perform computation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 42.00 425.00 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.00 425.00 Td (It protects data privacy by passing only metadata to the LLM layer.) Tj ET
