BT /F2 10 Tf 42.00 722.00 Td (5. Workflow Planning) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 708.00 Td (The WorkflowAgent prepares preprocessing actions such as missing value handling,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 696.00 Td (categorical encoding, numerical scaling, target preparation, and model-ready feature) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 684.00 Td (creation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 42.00 663.00 Td (6. Model Selection) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 649.00 Td (The ModelStrategistAgent selects algorithms based on the detected task. Classification) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 637.00 Td (uses Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and XGBoost. Regression uses Linear Regression,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 625.00 Td (Random Forest Regressor, and XGBoost Regressor. Clustering uses KMeans and DBSCAN.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 613.00 Td (Forecasting uses ARIMA and Exponential Smoothing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 42.00 592.00 Td (7. Training and Optimization) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 578.00 Td (The ML engine trains multiple models using scikit-learn, XGBoost, and statsmodels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 566.00 Td (Optuna is used for hyperparameter optimization so the system can improve performance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 554.00 Td (beyond default settings.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 42.00 533.00 Td (8. Evaluation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 519.00 Td (The EvaluationAgent benchmarks models with task-specific metrics. Classification uses) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 507.00 Td (accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, ROC-AUC, and confusion matrix. Regression uses) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 495.00 Td (RMSE, MAE, and R2 score. Clustering uses silhouette score. Forecasting uses AIC, BIC,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 483.00 Td (and forecast values.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 42.00 462.00 Td (9. Explainability and Final Report) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 448.00 Td (The ExplainabilityAgent uses SHAP to show feature importance and model behavior. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 436.00 Td (ReportAgent generates a business-friendly summary with data findings, model comparison,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54.00 424.00 Td (best model, explainability insights, and recommendations.) Tj ET
